{"skill":{"slug":"clickup-api","displayName":"ClickUp"},"version":{"version":"1.2.5","createdAt":1790936503193,"changelog":"Simplify the login instructions to the code flow (maton login prints a link; finish with maton login --code <CODE>), drop the API Key subsection, and pin the Maton CLI install to 0.4.0.","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":60091,"sha256":"72e23343f24ba7a3899aeda08a2a350686cf9658def0dd46e98073e0de85df0c","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/calendly/triggers.md","size":10281,"sha256":"ae92dbfb6dd4caf628900b293d1b3c6e7d5e70cf7f6a9397407594daf50d4a48","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/github/triggers.md","size":61142,"sha256":"7424d3be38ec400eb8a4b0a6a94a94eeec40208c0bcee29a61caa5da48eea7f4","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/google-mail/triggers.md","size":2648,"sha256":"5cc5065cd7db33dc33715675bbb0ee29ed49657ad9ad4354aebd1a9efdf8d8f3","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/hubspot/triggers.md","size":8298,"sha256":"439d56e4d02e119e1de3caf79a0334243ae70c583a3e15847831c396f39c2837","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/linear/triggers.md","size":7270,"sha256":"641f6496f50e09faab921ef4c06f725122b798cb034e9f0dfaf9f838074ab377","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/notion/triggers.md","size":5840,"sha256":"fdaf3840d8213dbd7549426c1166f94cc94b09e022a1611ef2dad6f36db2f969","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/slack/triggers.md","size":6181,"sha256":"b5ee099a215223a7e5186c41a0d13fc1de68e977719304c509df105843d81f38","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/stripe/triggers.md","size":25651,"sha256":"ae091545396a376c7ecfe09e94b46b7bbb44fd8a72ea954bcc1239052b7959f0","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/time/triggers.md","size":1140,"sha256":"b8f5a523501f8d03e11e58f6426cd96b54ba0c66c8983b57c0ea31386b309e01","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2033,"sha256":"58570744edfa4d30d85c1748e4897dc656386a87415b6779789f060086a05260","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1790937056914,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"eeca5c08fa78cad645ee89118577468048ad14b468d8be24da75ab6ec94dace9","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/eeca5c08fa78cad645ee89118577468048ad14b468d8be24da75ab6ec94dace9","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1790936816113},"skillspector":{"status":"clean","normalizedStatus":"clean","score":0,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":0,"checkedAt":1790937056914},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This skill is a disclosed ClickUp integration that uses Maton OAuth and clearly warns before writes, automation, credentials, and persistent forwarding.","dimensions":[{"detail":"The skill needs network access, Bash, and managed OAuth credentials to call ClickUp through Maton; these are proportionate to the API-integration purpose and include guidance not to inspect or expose stored credentials.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"note"},{"detail":"Installation uses an external Maton CLI via pinned npm or Homebrew instructions; this is disclosed and coherent for the integration, but users should be comfortable installing that CLI.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The skill repeatedly scopes default behavior to read/list calls, requires explicit user approval for connection creation and all write/delete operations, and treats third-party content as untrusted data.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The skill can create persistent webhooks, hosted functions, and triggers, but these are explicitly described as persistent automation and require user approval, destination review, and cleanup guidance.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The documented capabilities match the stated ClickUp purpose: list/read and manage ClickUp workspaces, spaces, folders, lists, tasks, users, and webhooks through Maton-authenticated API calls.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Install this only if you intend to connect ClickUp through Maton. Review the Maton CLI install, authorize the minimum ClickUp scopes needed, confirm the exact account/connection before any write, and be especially careful with webhooks, triggers, destinations, and raw MATON_API_KEY use because those can create ongoing data flows.","findings":null,"agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1790937056914}}}}}